      "The smoke goes straight up, because there is no wind now. Madame Casanova stands on the church steps in front of the village, and she stops, the way she always does. "
      "Nobody starts to clap. The man who always started is gone. On the ground by the gate lies a folded sheet: MINICU in a careful hand, and twice below it, crooked. "
      "In Alva's bar, the chalkboard says Paid. P., in the same careful hand, and under it lie new, smooth banknotes, like the ones from the captain's purse. "
      "Kevin, the seagull, is back on the gate. He is waiting.",
      [Z("casanova", "...Ring the bell.", "sadness"),
       Z("holm", "The church is still standing. Alva's group: no word. Minicu: they carried him into the church, and Don is sitting with him. Pascal: gone.", "sadness"),
       Z("holm", "Faen. Give me a second. ...Keep the rifle until the rematch, Frankfurt. I can't hold it straight tonight.", "sadness"),
       Z("siri", "Duc? Yasin filmed all of it. When the net comes back, can I post it? In my own words.", "sadness")],
